            "block_content": "f.  $ \\underline{\\text{Work Schedules.}} $ Schedules showing each employee's shift, workdays, and nours snail be posted in the appropriate department at all times. Changes in work schedules, from shift to shift, may occur for valid cause or as mutually agreed.",
