        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Employees who extend their bid for a back-to-back assignment may not use their seniority to bid the same assignment until two (2) years from the date they were scheduled to vacate the post. Where an employee does not bid the same post back to back, the employee may not exercise their seniority to bid the same post until twenty-four (24) months has passed from the date of the employee's assignment.",
